{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798320/extras/6734349fa29a683954f5840aa4953929.poster.avif?t=1764153330\" width=618 height=185 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798320/extras/6734349fa29a683954f5840aa4953929.webm?t=1764153330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sami is busy celebrating his birthday party, when suddenly, the evil Albert VII appears in the sky riding his new airship and kidnaps all of Sami's friends! Rumors say that Albert VII plans to open a zoo on the moon... Could he be plotting to add Sami's friends to the exhibit?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Sami free his friends one by one as you visit all kinds of exciting and wondrous locations and get ready to run, jump, rail grind and, most of all, roll your way to victory! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798320/extras/a8ba244603e07c155b649c401881afde.poster.avif?t=1764153330\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798320/extras/a8ba244603e07c155b649c401881afde.webm?t=1764153330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798320/extras/a8ba244603e07c155b649c401881afde.mp4?t=1764153330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798320/extras/98abd86f9bc4fdd34913cfa37333e691.poster.avif?t=1764153330\" width=618 height=185 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798320/extras/98abd86f9bc4fdd34913cfa37333e691.webm?t=1764153330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > New <strong>exciting and colorful environments</strong>\u00a0across 5 worlds that will take you from a bustling city to a candy factory and even outer space!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Several playable characters</strong> with distinct abilities such as gliding, wall-running, or even turning into a wild tornado</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Customizable outfits</strong> for the main characters (of course!) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pets</strong> that follow your characters around. And some come from other games!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Accessibility options</strong> to make sure that everybody has an awesome time! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Secrets</strong>! Including tons of secret levels to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extremely cute cutscene</strong>\u00a0<strong>illustrations\u00a0</strong>drawn by the one and only Kevin Fagaragan!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Returning of Evader Music for an <strong>amazing upbeat soundtrack</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798320/extras/ac2968ec7d54e92835f0b3a9119ec8c5.poster.avif?t=1764153330\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798320/extras/ac2968ec7d54e92835f0b3a9119ec8c5.webm?t=1764153330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798320/extras/ac2968ec7d54e92835f0b3a9119ec8c5.mp4?t=1764153330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How do you play Super Sami Roll 2?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Sami Roll is not your standard 3D platformer series, these are rolling-physics based platformers! Movement is free-form and expressive, allowing for unique playstyles and precise control as you navigate your way through each of the challenging levels on offer. Keep your momentum up by using Sami\u2019s tongue to grapple and jump over dangerous obstacles and enemies, and sometimes even skip entire areas! <br><br>It's up to you to create your own path. Do you want to take it slow and enjoy the beautiful scenery, or do you want to discover all of the skips and tricks to be the fastest lizard possible?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do I need to have played Super Sami Roll 1 before?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No. In terms of story and gameplay, both titles are standalone experiences, so you can play them in any order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What's Sonzai Games done before Super Sami Roll 1 and 2?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since its founding in 2020, Sonzai Games has also developed the 2D retro platformer Bat Boy, in addition to helping with the development of other cool indie titles such as Last Time I Saw You and Smelter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Once again, it's time to ROLL!</strong></i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2798320?t=1764153330","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2798320?t=1764153330","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2798320/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764153330","capsule_imagev5":"https://shar